From 7ce1dcdcee4dec45d3fcaddeef2f19ef81f6ff32 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seedds <seedds@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 15:23:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Odyssey HUD move / resize + full-screen UI (0113)

Two cuts into Pane::Calculate (entry + 0x13c) so static panes are hooked too;
structural counter matching (TxtTotalShine / TxtCounterSh / TxtLife under a
small RootPane); PauseMenu and WorldMap roots classified by subtree and both
widened to the screen shape so their backgrounds fill it (the map's picture
behind it has to fill the screen); log grows to 160 entries of 64 bytes with
native + scaled root pairs.
---
